<view class="page">
  <text class="title">本轮训练</text><text class="subtitle">每组最多 5 词；当前从详情页练习 1 词</text>
  <view class="card"><text class="card-title">必测维度</text>
    <view class="option {{meaning ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-key="meaning" bindtap="toggleDimension"><view><text>认义</text><text class="desc">看英文，主动回忆审核释义</text></view><text>{{meaning ? '✓' : ''}}</text></view>
    <view class="option {{spelling ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-key="spelling" bindtap="toggleDimension"><view><text>拼写</text><text class="desc">看中文，拼写目标英文词</text></view><text>{{spelling ? '✓' : ''}}</text></view>
  </view>
  <view class="card review"><view><text class="card-title">本轮新词加入复习</text><text class="desc">默认关闭；打开后只对已练词生效</text></view><switch checked="{{addToReview}}" bindchange="toggleReview" color="#315c45" /></view>
  <view class="notice"><text>练习完成、已理解、加入生词本和加入复习是四个独立动作。</text></view>
  <button class="primary" loading="{{acting}}" disabled="{{acting}}" bindtap="start">开始记忆训练</button>
</view>
